<title>USA: Lakeway, Texas, won by Morgan Keegan.</title>
<headline>Lakeway, Texas, won by Morgan Keegan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Keegan said it won $1.600 million of Lakeway, Texas, general obligation limited tax bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.5524 percent.</p>
